# The deployed browser model is the exception to the weights rules above. GitHub Pages
# serves web/ as static files, so the .onnx the site loads has to be committed; it is
# quantised to about 10 MB for exactly that reason. Everything else stays ignored.
!web/models/*.onnx
!web/models/manifest.json